                 same design index 1 as the coupling: with "Not fitted" no <hose> passes the gate, so no receiver
                 hose is injected at all and a tractor-mounted fill arm has nothing to connect to - rather than a
                 hose running to a hidden node. "first config-gate match wins", so this must stay the only hose. -->
            <hose inputAttacherJointIndices="1" type="TOOL_CONNECTOR_TOP_RIGHT" node="slurryPipe" length="2" diameter="0.18" isTwoPointHose="true"
                  configType="design" cylinderedConfigIndex="1">
